								<p class="newsTitle">
									Stuff - 
									2/18/2005 5:46:14 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<div align="center">Alot of things have happened recently.... Stratholme( i know i spelled that wrong) runs, lower BRS runs to get keys.... upper brs to get the Onyxia things.... even our lower levels are having fun doing chain Maraudon runs and the such it seems..... no matter what always something to do somewhere. DKP was just introduced into the guild, seems to be taking rather well.... As for me after&nbsp;the loss (not really a loss, he's just a dildo) of our&nbsp; &lt;wonderful&gt; guild leader Wars to the pressures of the outside world, I've taken temporary command of the guild until Wars comes back and we feel he is capable to lead us or someone more capable then me steps up... (i realize i'm not the best at this game, there are better people, in order to be the best guild possible we will have the best leader we can possibly have. Till then it's me.) But yeah. that last post was here far too long, things are happening rapidly. we haven't died or anything, alot of stuff happening = no time to post new things~ but i'll start posting raid pictures as soon as i figure out how and do alot more interesting things with the site~ Till next time, see ya~ <div align="center"><br /><b> Ziga Phous~</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <div align="center"> </div> </div> </div> <div align="center"> <span style="font-weight: bold;">Post comments <a href="/forums/message.aspx?mid=139293">here</a></span><br /> </div> 
